                <pb facs="1188" n="1182" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1182"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President tenders his heartfelt condolences by reason of your great
                    bereavement. I add my tribute of sincere sorrow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
